senses.gloss:
--a name of वासुदेव;
1: वा. ९६. ५१; १०६. ५४.
विष्णु who took the form of हयग्रीव and appeared before Agastya at काञ्ची;
2: Br. II. १९. १८०; २५. ५६-7; III. ७१. ७८ and ९३; ७३. ८७; IV. 5. 8, १४; 9. २८, ४७, ६४; १२. २१; १५. १४.
as brother of देवी put down the हिरण्यस् in the भण्ड-Lalita1 war;
3: Br. II. २९. १०३, १३३.
as Kalki put down the हूणस्, Yava- nas, etc;
4: Br. II. ३९. ४९.
in the form of पितृस् in गया;
5: वा. १०८. ८५, ८९; १०९. २४ and ३४.
became black due to poison;
6: वा. ५४. ५९.
becomes ब्रह्मा, विष्णु and शिव affected by the qualities of सत्व, रजस् and तमस्;
7: Vi. I. 2. ६१-7.
manifestation and forms described.
8: Vi. I. २२. २३-72; III. 8. ११; १८. ३५.
